[12.335177, "o", "  MMA · capacitor · switch · quark orbit · measurement debate. \u001b[1mstructure without\r\n"]
[12.335184, "o", "  substance, circling. the spiral isn't a bug in the machine — it's a legal\r\n  state of matter.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.335191, "o", "\r\n"]
[12.335197, "o", "  \u001b[1m\u001b[33mGUARD MAP — where the spiral could have been broken:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.335211, "o", "    \u001b[36mL0/L5 client+gateway  \u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.335221, "o", "      fail : \u001b[2mstream held open forever by heartbeats\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.335228, "o", "      guard: hard total-duration timeout on the client AND gateway\r\n"]
