[12.335405, "o", "  \u001b[1mbottom line for security engineering:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.335412, "o", "    every automated layer was present and healthy. \u001b[31mzero automated guards\r\n"]
[12.33542, "o", "    fired.\u001b[0m the spiral lived in the gap between 'nothing failed' and\r\n    'nobody stopped it.' instrument the meaning layers (L0–L6): timeouts,\r\n"]
