[12.335434, "o", "\r\n"]
[12.33553, "o", "  \u001b[2mthe question outlasted HTTP, CUDA, silicon, atoms, nuclei, quarks,\r\n  fields, and the planck wall. the loop was never in the machine.\r\n  the machine was a place the loop briefly stopped.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  watchdog inventory, this run: simulated-agent guards fired 0 · demo control that ended it: operator deadline (--seconds 1s).\r\n  \u001b[2mfield sessions to date: automated 0 · human Ctrl+C 4/4.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
